  m_text: "Opening a small business loan is a smart move if you're ready to grow.
    Think of it as giving your business a boost\u2014you get access to extra cash
    that you can use to stock up on inventory, upgrade your workspace, or even hire
    employees to speed up your progress. \n\nYou'll have to make regular payments,
    but if you manage it wisely, you'll build your credit score and unlock better
    financial tools down the line. \n\nTaking on a loan isn\u2019t about debt\u2014it\u2019s
    about using resources strategically to reach your goals faster."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6e6891c03f13f1e44a213bc615ab5855, type: 2}
